      "extract": "On a volume invariant of 3–manifolds Marc Kegel, Arunima Ray, Jonathan Spreer, Em Thompson and Stephan Tillmann Abstract This paper investigates a real-valued topological invariant of 3–manifolds called topological volume. For a given 3–manifold M , the topological volume volt(M) is defined as the smallest volume of the complement of a (possibly empty) hyperbolic link in M . Various refinements of this invariant are",
