      "extract": "\\label{ssec:refinements} Let $M$ be a closed, orientable $3$--manifold. For each integer $n\\ge 0,$ we define the invariant \\begin{equation} \\volt_n(M) = \\inf \\big\\{ \\; \\volh(M\\setminus K) \\;\\mid \\; K \\subset M \\text{ is a hyperbolic $n$--component link } \\; \\big\\}. \\end{equation} For all $n\\ge 1$ and all closed, orientable 3--manifolds $M$, we have $\\volt(M)\\le \\volt_n(M)$. In particular, $\\volt(M)=\\volt_0(M)<",
      "extractCut": true
